  <item>
    <title>莫向外求之后还能去哪? 互联网初代创业者30+退休在西雅图开咖啡店</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6757266217cd5416adc5f9f9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6757266217cd5416adc5f9f9</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Dec 2024 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>「对话女性创造者」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>各位盖亚的伙伴们大家好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>❤️🔥 本期节目我们有幸邀请到了《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e2ea2e0418a84a046bea20d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e2ea2e0418a84a046bea20d"><span>随机漫谈Random Talk</span></a><span>》、《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64f382bd3fa4090b74fb347b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64f382bd3fa4090b74fb347b"><span>虾聊会</span></a><span>》的主理人、西雅图</span><a href="https://story-coffee.square.site/" data-url="https://story-coffee.square.site/"><span>Story Coffee</span></a><span>老板娘*Rachel！</span></p><span></span><p><span>2008年，中国互联网浪潮伊始，北大数学系的大三学生成立了自己的第一家数据咨询公司，毕业后在创新工场当过投资人，做过生意也做过技术创业，是名副其实的卷王连续创业者。</span><br><span>现在在她的而立之年，她搬到西雅图在美国经营一家咖啡馆。对她来说，不管是开公司，还是做播客、写作，都是在“CREATE 创造”，也是体验人生的方式。那么，Rachel 的职业/创业经历是怎样的？过往的人生如何塑造了现在的 Rachel ？历经三分之一人生后 Rachel 对生活的态度有什么变化？欢迎收听节目一探究竟</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💎 本期你会听到的内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a> Rachel和她的Story Coffee</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">03:54</a> 咖啡馆之外的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">04:59</a> 生活状态的对比：大学期间vs现在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">06:32</a> 中国互联网浪潮之初-大学毕业之后的工作/创业经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="657">10:57</a> 早期职业经历带来的收获</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">12:32</a> 描述创业期间的三个形容词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">15:54</a> 连续创业的源动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> 不同时代背景下的创业人心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1284">21:24</a> 创业顺利与否的关键难点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 回顾过去，自己是怎样的性格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1624">27:04</a> 过去的人生经历给自己带来了什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1863">31:03</a> 一些life changing moments</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">33:11</a> 初到异国他乡时的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> 人生是没有意义的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2203">36:43</a> 我本自足与生命能量desire</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2361">39:21</a> 人生是用来体验的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">40:39</a> 允许自己是个初学者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2616">43:36</a> 创作与表达是留在世界的礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3010">50:10</a> 想对年轻创业人说的话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3052">50:52</a> 谈恋爱与认识自我、他人和世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3289">54:49</a> 阅读的选择：非虚构vs虚构？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3383">56:23</a> 最近的轻松读物</span></p><span></span><p><span>👏 添加管理员进入听友群，和全球的主播/嘉宾/伙伴一起交流 </span><strong><br><span>👏 </span></strong><span>剪辑制作：梦昕</span><strong><br><span> </span><br><span>📬 联系我们</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>听友群/联络：微信 leah1134676861</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>商务合作：changyuxin0321@gmail.com</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小红书：Leah粒牙</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>盖亚计划小助手：xbcql1008，添加小助手请备注来意</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
