  <item>
    <title>华人女性在美国创立一家VC需要几步</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b70524513a776b57b48038</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b70524513a776b57b48038</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jan 2024 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>「对话女性创造者」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>各位盖亚的伙伴们新年好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>❤️‍🔥 本期节目我们有幸邀请到 </span><strong><span>Flying Tiger Capital的创始人：Jasmine女士</span></strong><span>！Jasmine在中国长大，在澳洲求学，在美国开展职业，在科技行业深耕近10年后决定自己创业成立一家投资机构 🎉</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次聊天，Jasmine着重聊了聊她丰富的</span><strong><span>国际化经历</span></strong><span>，和做</span><strong><span>投资人的感悟</span></strong><span>，希望能给有着相似背景和经历的伙伴带来灵感！</span></p><span></span><p><span>💎 本期你会听到的内容：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> 嘉宾背景介绍</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a> 美国VC角度对当下市场的感受</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 在美国进入VC的路径：个人天使投资</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 在美国华人投资人的身份体感</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1772">29:32</a> 在科技大厂多年学到了什么</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 为什么选择在一家公司深耕8年</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3004">50:04</a> 在海外职场升级打怪的Tips</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3264">54:24</a> 华人在美国的生存空间</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3337">55:37</a> 海外华人的Forever homesick</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3626">1:00:26</a> Jasmine做出过最重要的三个决定</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3883">1:04:43</a> 对年轻女士的建议</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3992">1:06:32</a> 对海外华人的建议</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4164">1:09:24</a> 荐书环节</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Jasmine的播客：</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/ua/podcast/mommy-and-money-with-jasmine-yu-zhang/id1625022617" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/ua/podcast/mommy-and-money-with-jasmine-yu-zhang/id1625022617"><span>Mommy and Money with Jasmine Yu Zhang</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Jasmine推荐书籍：Empire Builder: The Road to a Billion -- Adam Coffey</span></p><span></span><p><span>👏 添加管理员进入听友群，和全球的主播/嘉宾/伙伴一起交流</span></p><span></span><p><span>📬 联系我们</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>听友群/联络：微信 leah1134676861</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>商务合作：changyuxin0321@gmail.com</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>即刻：</span><a href="https://okjk.co/DEKbBc" data-url="https://okjk.co/DEKbBc"><span>Leah粒牙</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>小红书：Leah粒牙</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
