    <title>投资创业两不误，和入行六年的女性投资人聊聊FemTech和出海.Vol3</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6528db2aba2ed85c6d2267bf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6528db2aba2ed85c6d2267bf</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Oct 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「</span><strong><span>对话女性创造者</span></strong><span>」</span></p><span></span><p><span>第三期节目，我们有幸邀请到一位特殊的嘉宾：Kate！她</span><strong><span>既是投资人也是创业者</span></strong><span>，甚至还写过商业报道，Kate目前就职于一家外资投资机构，主要专注于泛科技领域的投资、咨询，17年开始专注于出海</span><strong><span>东南亚市场投资</span></strong><span>；本期节目我们一起来聊聊她是如何</span><strong><span>兼顾投资职业和创业，双线开花❤️‍🔥</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>📌本期你会听到的内容：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 嘉宾介绍</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 职业生涯的起点</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 投出第一个项目</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">12:03</a> 创业者和投资人角色互换</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> VC是否还是一个好职业</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a> 什么时候意识到要开展副业</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1156">19:16</a> 做投资的遗憾</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> Kate的MBTI</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">22:33</a> 做投资最开心的事儿</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 投资这事儿有点虚？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">24:48</a> 近期关注：FemTech行业（为女性科技打call！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a> “看不见的女性”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> 出海新趋势/机会</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2008">33:28</a> 中国车企弯道超车</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">38:05</a> 投资人还在关注哪些赛道</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2376">39:36</a> 给毕业生的建议</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>💁‍♀️本期提到的部分内容</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Femtech（女性科技）行业</span></strong><span>是一个专注于通过技术和数字化解决方案改善女性健康和福祉的领域。该行业涵盖了从生殖健康、怀孕和新生儿护理，到更年期管理和女性特定的营养和健身需求等多个方面。Femtech的目标是满足女性在各个生命周期阶段的特定需求，通过创新技术使她们的生活更加健康和舒适。</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35942057/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35942057/"><strong><span>《看不见的女性》</span></strong></a><span>—— [英] 卡罗琳·克里亚多·佩雷斯：本书用海量数据和事例讲述了女性被系统性忽略的残酷事实。在大量“性别中立”的规则背后，男性往往被视为默认选项，女性则被视而不见。</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>📬 联系我们</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>联系Leah进听友群（wx: leah1134676861）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>商务合作：changyuxin0321@gmail.com</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>即刻：</span><a href="https://okjk.co/DEKbBc" data-url="https://okjk.co/DEKbBc"><span>Leah粒牙</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>💃 Staff</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>主播：Leah, Kate</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>制作：Leah, Jessica</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
